WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.066
Dear Ms Schneider,

00:00:02.316 --> 00:00:17.627
Unfortunately I cannot come to the German course today or tomorrow. I have had a fever and a bad headache since yesterday evening. This morning I went to the doctor. He says I have the flu and must stay in bed for three days.

00:00:17.877 --> 00:00:26.907
Could you please send me the homework by email? I would like to study the lesson at home so that I don't miss too much.

00:00:27.157 --> 00:00:36.419
We have the test on Thursday, don't we? If I am well again, I will of course come. If not, I will call you on Wednesday.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:40.141
Many thanks and best wishes
Amira Haddad
